{"page":548,"width":1543,"height":2326,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"13.1 동적 계획법의 개요","words":[{"text":"13.1","x":170,"y":207,"width":79,"height":37},{"text":"동적","x":271,"y":203,"width":70,"height":43},{"text":"계획법의","x":358,"y":201,"width":143,"height":44},{"text":"개요","x":518,"y":200,"width":74,"height":43}]},{"text":"우리가 두 번째로 살펴볼 알고리즘 설계 기법은 동적 계획법입니다. 동적 계획법은 2자 세계대전 직","words":[{"text":"우리가","x":168,"y":290,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":255,"y":291,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"번째로","x":291,"y":288,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"살펴볼","x":372,"y":288,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘","x":458,"y":288,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"설계","x":571,"y":286,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"기법은","x":632,"y":285,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"동적","x":719,"y":284,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"계획법입니다.","x":784,"y":282,"width":166,"height":34},{"text":"동적","x":962,"y":281,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"계획법은","x":1027,"y":280,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"2자","x":1148,"y":279,"width":47,"height":32},{"text":"세계대전","x":1204,"y":278,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"직","x":1336,"y":277,"width":28,"height":32}]},{"text":"후 개발된 알고리즘 설계 기법인데요. 원래는 효율적 의사결정을 위해 만들어졌지만 장점이 많은 기","words":[{"text":"후","x":168,"y":350,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"개발된","x":206,"y":349,"width":75,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘","x":290,"y":348,"width":101,"height":31},{"text":"설계","x":400,"y":348,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"기법인데요.","x":460,"y":348,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"원래는","x":606,"y":346,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"효율적","x":693,"y":345,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"의사결정을","x":783,"y":344,"width":134,"height":33},{"text":"위해","x":926,"y":344,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"만들어졌지만","x":989,"y":342,"width":168,"height":34},{"text":"장점이","x":1166,"y":341,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":1264,"y":341,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"기","x":1336,"y":339,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"법이다 보니 현재는 컴퓨터 과학, 경제, 생명공학. 항공우쭈 공학 등 다양한 분야에서 활